    "description": {
      "values": [
        {
          "locale": "en-US",
          "value": "Vertical stitch detailing gives a plain crew neck something to look at without turning it into a statement piece. Fine gauge knit with a ribbed collar, cuffs and hem for a clean finish. Sizes 8 to 22, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "en-GB",
          "value": "Vertical stitch detailing gives a plain crew neck something to look at without turning it into a statement piece. Fine gauge knit with a ribbed collar, cuffs and hem for a clean finish. Sizes 8 to 22, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "es-ES",
          "value": "Los detalles de punto vertical dan a un sencillo jersey de cuello redondo algo que mirar, sin convertirlo en una prenda protagonista. Punto fino con cuello, puños y bajo de canalé para un acabado limpio. Tallas de la 8 a la 22, lavable a máquina."
        },
        {
          "locale": "fr-FR",
          "value": "Des détails de mailles verticales donnent du relief à un simple pull col rond, sans en faire une pièce forte. Maille fine avec col, poignets et bas côtelés pour une finition nette. Tailles 8 à 22, lavable en machine."
        },
        {
          "locale": "de-DE",
          "value": "Vertikale Strickdetails geben einem schlichten Rundhalspullover etwas fürs Auge, ohne ihn zum Statement-Teil zu machen. Feiner Strick mit Rippbündchen an Kragen, Ärmeln und Saum für einen sauberen Abschluss. Größen 8 bis 22, maschinenwaschbar."
        },
        {
          "locale": "it-IT",
          "value": "Le lavorazioni verticali danno a un semplice girocollo qualcosa da guardare, senza trasformarlo in un capo protagonista. Maglia fine con collo, polsini e fondo a costine per una finitura pulita. Taglie dalla 8 alla 22, lavabile in lavatrice."
        }
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "schema": "http://bigcontent.io/cms/schema/v1/core#/definitions/localized-value"
      }
    }
